// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`pdx substrate > keeps default help human-readable 1`] = `
"pdx

Local supervisor for Pandora's Box agent runs, processes, tmux sessions, and Pandora.

Usage:
  pdx <command>

Commands:
  init      Initialize the pdx data dir and seeded bundle templates only.
  open      Open the box: start pdx supervision and the Pandora HITL singleton.
  close     Close the box: stop pdx supervision and clean up supervised runs.
  daemon    Daemon supervisor commands.
  run       Inspect or stop supervised agent runs owned by pdx.
  task      Operate on live supervision for Pithos tasks.
  hook      Control the supervised input hook process.
"
`;
